        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遥豊のサレテ is a roguelite action game featuring item crafting elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the weapons and equipment you craft to defeat a set number of enemies within the time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the action part, your goal is to defeat the specified number of enemies within the time limit.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only control movement — weapons are used automatically.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain materials depending on the number of enemies defeated.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057000/extras/d56d9d1a4318308a29a6c5c6b0433e47.avif?t=1764094652\" width=1280 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you collect enough experience and level up, you can choose and equip new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The equipment presented at level up is crafted, and you select from among your crafted setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057000/extras/ed91b47e29ad597784ebb03c1b54570d.avif?t=1764094652\" width=1280 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can craft new weapons and support equipment using materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Materials and weapons have quality levels — higher quality means stronger effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to three traits can be granted, producing a variety of effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057000/extras/5c2aa3c000748038c4dcb0e656a58c96.avif?t=1764094652\" width=1280 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using “Land Growth Elixirs”, you can strengthen the land that serves as a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to obtain higher-quality materials, or even materials that normally can’t be found in that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057000/extras/f46e21175b68747dce6a203946a0c723.avif?t=1764094652\" width=1280 height=960 /></span></p>",
