ps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057000/extras/5c2aa3c000748038c4dcb0e656a58c96.avif?t=1764094652\" width=1280 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using “Land Growth Elixirs”, you can strengthen the land that serves as a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to obtain higher-quality materials, or even materials that normally can’t be found in that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057000/extras/f46e21175b68747dce6a203946a0c723.avif?t=1764094652\" width=1280 height=960 /></span></p>",
